# This app calls Groq's AI API through a Netlify serverless function
# (netlify/functions/chat.js), which keeps this key secret on the server.
#
# 1. Get a free key at https://console.groq.com/keys
# 2. Locally: copy this file to ".env" and paste your key below,
#    then run `netlify dev` (not `npm run dev`) so the function has access to it.
# 3. On Netlify: Site configuration -> Environment variables -> add GROQ_API_KEY.
GROQ_API_KEY=
